  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Interview w/ Jim James (MP3 only, see below)**: rare: 3 archived performances [2]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2000-10-15.KVRX** (recommended): pre-FM broadcast master; 12 songs; 56 min [1]. Said about its sound: Low-quality tape transfer of the Real Audio interview, included as MP3 track twelve [1]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- FM broadcast featured a Jim James interview between Honest Man and One Big Holiday [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2000-10-15.KVRX**: taped by Erik Wofford (KVRX recording engineer); transfer to CD-R by Andrew Schmidt (KVRX); transferred by Magnix (EAC-rip and SHN-compression); source: pre-FM > CD-R [1]",
